If you see this error, you can either:

    * Upgrade the Performance Monitoring plugin to v1.1.1 or later (the most recent is v1.4.2). 

    * Replace the Performance Monitoring plugin dependency line in your **root-level (project-level)** Gradle file ( ` <project>/build.gradle.kts ` or ` <project>/build.gradle ` ), as follows: 

